# qwen3.5-9b-rag-think: for answering WITH reasoning (--think / eval runs with
# thinking on). Qwen's recommended thinking-mode sampling for Qwen3.5: they
# warn against greedy decoding with thinking, and presence_penalty 1.5 is
# their remedy for endless repetition. With temperature 0 (the default model)
# a strict prompt made the reasoning walk every source line ("I will cite
# [2]" x15) until the cap: 32-43 of 92 answers empty (DEVLOG §24-25).
# Not deterministic: send a seed per request for repeatable runs.
# Create or update with:  ollama create qwen3.5-9b-rag-think -f models/Modelfile.think
FROM qwen3.5:9b
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
# Safety cap on output length (DEVLOG §20).
PARAMETER num_predict 4096
